        "subject": "LU-19179 utils: remove outdated handling in liblnetconfig",
        "message": "LU-19179 utils: remove outdated handling in liblnetconfig\n\nWe no longer need to define RDMA_PS_TCP since the value\nis available on all platforms. Our netlink handling had\nsome work arounds for older libnl versions which we no\nlong need to handle since RHEL7 support is gone.\n\nChange-Id: I655c7a109b59d6ba3fa67c34ebfb7d58d434f76a\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nSigned-off-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65495\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
